              "content": "<div>1. Breast cancer diagnosis before age 50 years</div><div>2. Bilateral breast cancer</div><div>3. Family history of breast and ovarian cancer</div><div>4. Presence of breast cancer in &ge;1 male family member</div><div>5. Multiple cases of breast cancer in the family</div><div>6. One or more family members with 2 primary types of <i>BRCA</i>-related cancer</div><div>7. Ashkenazi Jewish ethnicity</div>"
