              "id": 2198,
              "content": "<div>1. Unexplained monoarthritis</div><div>2. Suspected joint infection</div><div>3. Unexplained joint effusion</div><div>4. Suspected crystal-induced arthritis</div><div>5. Suspected hemarthrosis</div><div>6. Symptomatic relief of a large effusion</div>"
